# Lignify's ruling: it "overwrites characteristic-defining abilities that specify the enchanted creature's power or
# toughness". Bot2's Tarmogoyf, with an instant (Lightning Bolt) in a graveyard, is a 1/2 by
# its own ability (layer 7a); once Lignify is attached it has lost that ability (CR 613.1f, 604.3) and its base power and
# toughness are 0/4 (layer 7b, CR 613.4b), whatever is in the graveyards. It stays a green creature, a Treefolk only.

